<title>SHARJAH: CRICKET-PAKISTAN WIN SINGER CHAMPIONS' TROPHY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN WIN SINGER CHAMPIONS' TROPHY.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH, United Arab Emirates 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan won the Singer Champions' Trophy after beating New Zealand by 41 runs in the final on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: New Zealand 119 all out in 36.5 over, Pakistan 160 all out 48.5 overs.</p>
</text>
